      "section": "EC",
      "title": "GATE EC — Electromagnetics | Maxwell's Equations & Plane Waves",
      "subject": "Electromagnetics & Antennas",
      "subjectSlug": "electromagnetics",
      "topic": "Maxwell's Equations & Plane Waves",
      "type": "NAT",
      "question": "<p>A uniform plane electromagnetic wave propagates in free space with permittivity $\\epsilon_0$ and permeability $\\mu_0$. The intrinsic wave impedance $\\eta_0 = \\sqrt{\\mu_0 / \\epsilon_0}$ (in Ohms) is closest to ________ (rounded off to nearest integer).</p>",
      "options": [],
      "structuredOptions": [],
      "answer": [
        "377.0"
      ],
      "tolerance": {
        "min": 375.0,
        "max": 379.0
      },
      "marks": 2,
      "negativeMarks": 0,
      "explanation": "<div class='space-y-2'><p><strong>Step-by-Step Solution (Electromagnetics & Antennas):</strong></p><p>$\\eta_0 = \\sqrt{\\frac{4\\pi \\times 10^{-7}}{8.854 \\times 10^{-12}}} \\approx 120\\pi \\approx 376.99 \\approx 377\\,\\Omega$.</p></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "gate-ec-elec-q2",
      "testId": "gate-subject-ece-electromagnetics",
      "year": 2024,
      "orderIndex": 2,
      "section": "EC",
      "title": "GATE EC — Electromagnetics | Transmission Lines & Smith Chart",
      "subject": "Electromagnetics & Antennas",
      "subjectSlug": "electromagnetics",
      "topic": "Transmission Lines & Smith Chart",
      "type": "MCQ",
      "question": "<p>A lossless transmission line with characteristic impedance $Z_0 = 50\\,\\Omega$ is terminated in a load impedance $Z_L = 100\\,\\Omega$. The voltage reflection coefficient $\\Gamma$ is:</p>",
      "options": [
        "$+0.333$",
        "$-0.333$",
        "$0$",
        "$+0.5$"
      ],
      "structuredOptions": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "text": "$+0.333$",
          "html": "$+0.333$"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "text": "$-0.333$",
          "html": "$-0.333$"
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "text": "$0$",
          "html": "$0$"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "text": "$+0.5$",
          "html": "$+0.5$"
        }
      ],
      "answer": [
        "A"
      ],
      "tolerance": null,
      "marks": 1,
      "negativeMarks": 0.33,
      "explanation": "<div class='space-y-2'><p><strong>Step-by-Step Solution (Electromagnetics & Antennas):</strong></p><p>$\\Gamma = \\frac{Z_L - Z_0}{Z_L + Z_0} = \\frac{100 - 50}{100 + 50} = \\frac{50}{150} = +\\frac{1}{3} = +0.333$.</p></div>"
    },
